---
args: {"source": "EvidencePage", "revisions": "KnowledgeRevision[]"}
returns: "QualifiedProposition[]"
---
Split at independently assessable propositions while preserving each local qualifier's scope. Distinguish an instruction from historical behavior and quotation of a third party. Attach the exact source edition and original author where evidenced. Do not turn a narrow quantified example into a universal product claim. Unknown referents, dates or modality remain uncertainty fields, not inferred page metadata.
